  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><strong><u>About our brand and products</u></strong>: <span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:#001d35;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Welcome to the Gibbs Fishing Affiliate Program! We're excited to have you join our community. Gibbs is a family of brands in the fishing industry. Our products are designed and produced to be the most effective fish-catching tools available to anglers everywhere! Salmon, trout, walleye, halibut, lake trout, and much more, will all find our lures, flashers, spoons, jigs, terminal tackle, and other gear irresistible. This also makes them the #1 choice of angler! Our catalog features hundreds of products that you will have access to promoting. You'll definitely \"catch\" the eye of customers everywhere!</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><br><strong><u>What makes us different</u></strong>: We are Canada's largest and oldest sport fishing tackle brand. Everyone who fishes knows Gibbs Fishing and our family of brands. We have paired history and heritage with innovation, acquisitions, and and unrelenting drive to be better, do more, and grow Gibbs to new heights.</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><br><strong><u>How affiliates can earn</u></strong>: Affiliate Partners earn commissions by promoting our fishing products and driving orders to <a href=\"https://www.gibbsfishing.com/\"><strong>www.gibbsfishing.com</strong></a>. You can promote individual products through our available product feed, links to our homepage, coupons, promotions, and other special opportunities.</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><br><strong><u>How to promote us</u></strong>: Listing your personal affiliate link on your social media, website, email blast, and other channels are great places to start! Anglers (fishermen and fisherwomen) are our main target audience. Other target audience members typically include hunters, hikers, campers, and other outdoor enthusiasts. Fishing is one of the most well-participated sports, hobbies, and recreational opportunities and is enjoyed by more people than just about any other sport or hobby. It's fun for the entire family! Everyone from weekend warriors to die-hard anglers to the folks who only participate once a year will enjoy fishing with our products.</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><br><u><strong>Other information</strong></u>: If you have any questions, please feel free to contact us at affiliates@gibbsdelta.com at any time. Our team is here to help answer any questions and set you up for immediate success with the Gibbs Fishing Affiliate Program!</p></div></div>",
